Subject: [PATCH 10/10] docs: publish MPL corresponding source offer

---
 OPEN_SOURCE_RELEASE.md |  8 ++++++++
 docker/ralue/README.md | 10 +++++++---
 2 files changed, 15 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/OPEN_SOURCE_RELEASE.md b/OPEN_SOURCE_RELEASE.md
index 104e1a57..9e85dfe7 100644
--- a/OPEN_SOURCE_RELEASE.md
+++ b/OPEN_SOURCE_RELEASE.md
@@ -27,6 +27,14 @@ Before a public binary or hosted client bundle is released:
 The release is not compliant merely because the repository exists: the source
 link must be available to recipients of the matching executable/client bundle.
 
+The corresponding source offer for the current public build is maintained at:
+
+https://github.com/lmg136-ua/career-hub/tree/main/open-source/ralue-editor
+
+It identifies the immutable upstream revision and contains an ordered patch
+series with the Ralue modifications and build/deployment files needed to
+reconstruct the distributed editor.
+
 Authoritative references:
 
 - https://www.mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/
diff --git a/docker/ralue/README.md b/docker/ralue/README.md
index f9cd604a..81354fa8 100644
--- a/docker/ralue/README.md
+++ b/docker/ralue/README.md
@@ -50,9 +50,10 @@ docker compose -f .\docker\ralue\compose.yml up -d
 
 The branded build uses the existing Ralue logo and favicon, reports itself as
 Ralue Editor, disables welcome/update/feedback and subscription upsells, and
-keeps the unrestricted non-home-mode connection behavior. Writer retains File,
-Home, Insert, Layout, Format, and contextual document tabs; review, references,
-forms, view, extensions, and help tabs are omitted from the default surface.
+keeps the unrestricted non-home-mode connection behavior. Writer exposes the
+complete English toolbar, including font controls and the File, Home, Insert,
+Layout, References, Review, Format, Form, View, and Help tabs, with Ralue's
+visual system applied without removing editing commands.
 
 ## Staging deployment
 
@@ -145,3 +146,6 @@ The upstream MPL-2.0 notices and source history stay intact. Ralue branding is
 applied only after this baseline passes its WOPI editing and save tests. Public
 distribution must include the corresponding modified source and must not use
 Collabora trademarks as the product identity.
+
+The corresponding source package for the published Ralue build is available at
+https://github.com/lmg136-ua/career-hub/tree/main/open-source/ralue-editor.
